{"id":12562,"date":"2025-05-16T12:00:36","date_gmt":"2025-05-16T12:00:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12562"},"modified":"2025-05-16T12:00:36","modified_gmt":"2025-05-16T12:00:36","slug":"chytre-pivo-zacina-v-nicoletu","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/chytre-pivo-zacina-v-nicoletu\/","title":{"rendered":"Chytr\u00e9 pivo za\u010d\u00edn\u00e1 v Nicoletu"},"content":{"rendered":"<h3 data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"370\">Spojili jsme FT-IR spektrometry Nicolet, um\u011blou inteligenci IBIS a autosampler SALSA. V\u00fdsledkem je <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/potravinarstvi-zemedelstvi-a-krmiva\/umela-inteligence-ve-sluzbach-piva-s-ft-ir-spektrometry-nicolet\/\">revolu\u010dn\u00ed anal\u00fdza piva b\u011bhem 3 minut<\/a>.<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"594\">Modern\u00ed pivovarnictv\u00ed se bez dat neobejde. A\u0165 u\u017e jde o optimalizaci v\u00fdroby, kontrolu kvality nebo hodnocen\u00ed st\u00e1rnut\u00ed piva, tradi\u010dn\u00ed metody nar\u00e1\u017eej\u00ed na sv\u00e9 limity \u2013 jsou pomal\u00e9, drah\u00e9 a vy\u017eaduj\u00ed rozs\u00e1hl\u00e9 laboratorn\u00ed z\u00e1zem\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"861\">Ve spolupr\u00e1ci s V\u00fdzkumn\u00fdm \u00fastavem pivovarsk\u00fdm a slada\u0159sk\u00fdm (V\u00daPS) jsme proto vyvinuli \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed, kter\u00e9 z\u00e1sadn\u011b m\u011bn\u00ed pravidla hry. Spojili jsme spolehlivost <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-summit\/\">FT-IR spektrometr\u016f<\/a> Nicolet<\/strong>, automatizaci <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/autosampler-salsa\/\"><strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"816\">autosampleru SALSA<\/strong><\/a> a s\u00edlu um\u011bl\u00e9 inteligence v syst\u00e9mu <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/potravinarstvi-zemedelstvi-a-krmiva\/umela-inteligence-ve-sluzbach-piva-s-ft-ir-spektrometry-nicolet\/\"><strong data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"860\">IBIS<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12112\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12112\" style=\"width: 500px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12112\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/04\/710a26af-300x235.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"392\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/04\/710a26af-300x235.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/04\/710a26af-1024x803.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/04\/710a26af-768x602.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/04\/710a26af-1536x1205.png 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/04\/710a26af.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12112\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-apex\/\"><strong>FT-IR spektrometr Nicolet<\/strong><\/a> a <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/autosampler-salsa\/\"><strong>autosampler SALSA<\/strong><\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h3 data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"907\"><\/h3>\n<h3 data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"907\">Co um\u00ed kombinace <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/potravinarstvi-zemedelstvi-a-krmiva\/umela-inteligence-ve-sluzbach-piva-s-ft-ir-spektrometry-nicolet\/\">Nicolet + SALSA + IBIS<\/a>?<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"960\">Analyzuje <strong data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"949\">v\u0161echny kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 parametry<\/strong> najednou<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1001\">M\u011b\u0159\u00ed <strong data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"999\">bez slo\u017eit\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edpravy vzorku<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1041\">Funguje <strong data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1039\">v libovoln\u00e9 f\u00e1zi v\u00fdroby<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1089\">Umo\u017e\u0148uje <strong data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1087\">okam\u017eitou optimalizaci procesu<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1143\">To v\u0161e b\u011bhem <strong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1115\">3 minut<\/strong> a na <strong data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1142\">jedin\u00e9m p\u0159\u00edstroji<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1173\">Co v\u0161echno zjist\u00edte?<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1383\">Neuronov\u00e1 s\u00ed\u0165 syst\u00e9mu <strong data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1204\">IBIS<\/strong> byla tr\u00e9nov\u00e1na na v\u00edce ne\u017e <strong data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1266\">3500 vzorc\u00edch z 170 druh\u016f piva<\/strong>. Dok\u00e1\u017ee tak nejen ur\u010dit z\u00e1kladn\u00ed chemick\u00e9 ukazatele, ale i hodnotit senzorick\u00e9 vlastnosti a p\u0159edv\u00eddat st\u00e1rnut\u00ed piva.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1406\">M\u011b\u0159en\u00e9 parametry:<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1449\">Obsah alkoholu (hmotnostn\u00ed i objemov\u00fd)<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1477\">Extrakt p\u016fvodn\u00ed mladiny<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1522\">Skute\u010dn\u00fd, zd\u00e1nliv\u00fd a dosa\u017eiteln\u00fd extrakt<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1537\">Prokva\u0161en\u00ed<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1549\">pH, IBU<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1591\">Polyfenoly, tanoidy, voln\u00fd aminodus\u00edk<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1610\">Stabilita p\u011bny<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1715\">N\u00e1chylnost ke st\u00e1rnut\u00ed a jeho senzorick\u00e9 projevy<br data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1664\" \/><em data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1715\">(nap\u0159. medovitost, pap\u00edrovitost, kovov\u00e1 pachu\u0165)<\/em><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1749\">IBIS vs. klasick\u00e9 metody<\/h2>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"2095\">\n<thead data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1803\">\n<tr data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1803\">\n<th data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1775\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1774\">Referen\u010dn\u00ed metody<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1803\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1801\">IBIS + FT-IR Nicolet<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"2095\">\n<tr data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1906\">\n<td data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1883\" data-col-size=\"sm\">V\u00fdsledky za 6\u20139 m\u011bs\u00edc\u016f<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1906\">V\u00fdsledky do 3 minut<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1957\">\n<td data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1932\" data-col-size=\"sm\">A\u017e 7 r\u016fzn\u00fdch p\u0159\u00edstroj\u016f<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1957\">1 p\u0159\u00edstroj na v\u0161echno<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2001\">\n<td data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1975\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Vysok\u00e9 n\u00e1klady<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2001\">N\u00edzk\u00e9 provozn\u00ed n\u00e1klady<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2061\">\n<td data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2039\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Pot\u0159eba specializovan\u00e9ho person\u00e1lu<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2061\">Intuitivn\u00ed obsluha<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2095\">\n<td data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2083\" data-col-size=\"sm\">A\u017e 55 hodin anal\u00fdz<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2095\">3 minuty<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3 data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2139\">Technologie, kter\u00e1 pracuje za v\u00e1s<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2405\"><strong data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2170\">FT-IR spektrometry Nicolet<\/strong> jsou spolehliv\u00e9, nen\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00e9 na obsluhu a poskytuj\u00ed p\u0159esn\u00e9 v\u00fdsledky b\u011bhem vte\u0159in a\u017e minut. Ve spojen\u00ed s <strong data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2296\">autosamplerem SALSA<\/strong>, vyvinut\u00fdm p\u0159\u00edmo pro kapaln\u00e9 vzorky jako pivo nebo v\u00edno, zvl\u00e1dnou bez probl\u00e9m\u016f rutinn\u00ed i pokro\u010dilou anal\u00fdzu.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2529\">D\u00edky syst\u00e9mu <strong data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2428\">IBIS<\/strong> nav\u00edc z\u00edsk\u00e1v\u00e1te v\u00fdhody um\u011bl\u00e9 inteligence bez nutnosti slo\u017eit\u00e9ho nastavov\u00e1n\u00ed nebo hlubok\u00e9 odbornosti.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2567\">Vy va\u0159\u00edte skv\u011bl\u00e9 pivo. O zbytek se postar\u00e1 na\u0161e technologie.<\/h3>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Spojili jsme FT-IR spektrometry Nicolet, um\u011blou inteligenci IBIS a autosampler SALSA. V\u00fdsledkem je revolu\u010dn\u00ed anal\u00fdza piva b\u011bhem 3 minut. Modern\u00ed pivovarnictv\u00ed se bez dat neobejde. A\u0165 u\u017e jde o optimalizaci v\u00fdroby, kontrolu kvality nebo hodnocen\u00ed st\u00e1rnut\u00ed piva, tradi\u010dn\u00ed metody nar\u00e1\u017eej\u00ed na sv\u00e9 limity \u2013 jsou pomal\u00e9, drah\u00e9 a vy\u017eaduj\u00ed rozs\u00e1hl\u00e9 laboratorn\u00ed z\u00e1zem\u00ed. Ve spolupr\u00e1ci s [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":12424,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[133,9],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-12562","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-13